graph TD
  A[Trusted application configuration] --> P[Immutable shared policy]
  P --> S[Baseline: data: in both modes; blob: only in Standard]
  S --> C[Image CSP: baseline plus exact HTTPS origins]
  S --> F[Font CSP: baseline plus separate font origins]
  F --> W[Trusted fonts load with readable fallback]
