  T --> C
  C --> D[Decoration displays]
  U[Supplied Markdown] --> R[Restricted reader and renderer]
  R --> I[Shared content image decision]
  P --> I
  I --> G[Require HTTPS, exact host and enforcement; Strict also requires current consent]
  G -->|Pass| V[Content image displays]
  G -->|Fail, including data and blob URLs| X[Inert source or placeholder]
